Merge origin/main (incremental transcript redaction) into feat/redaction-scanner-selection

Main's #2002 redacts large append-only transcripts incrementally: it
reuses the prefix redacted for the previous checkpoint and redacts only
the appended suffix, via RedactBlobBytes — the function this branch gave
an error return.

Composing them naively would have opened a sentinel bypass: a degraded
sole scanner would return under-scanned suffix bytes, and the incremental
path would splice them onto the cached prefix and persist the result.
redactIncrementally now returns an error, propagates the suffix
redaction's, and the call site fails the write on either that or the
whole-file fallback.

